WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 a59a1b57ba6073109ec594f8e88d8ef2

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.662
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, ulipokuwa ukiandika vitendakazi,

00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:06.032
kila kimoja kwa kiasi kikubwa

00:00:06.113 --> 00:00:08.353
kilijitegemea na kilikuwa na mantiki yote

00:00:08.373 --> 00:00:11.003
iliyohitaji ili kifanye kazi. Katika somo hili,

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.453
tutaangalia jinsi ya kugawanya vitendakazi ili

00:00:13.473 --> 00:00:16.493
tuwe na vitendakazi vidogo vinavyofanya kazi pamoja

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:18.893
badala ya vitendakazi vikubwa vyenye mambo mengi

00:00:18.953 --> 00:00:22.253
yanayoendelea. Kama kanuni ya jumla katika kupanga programu,

00:00:22.293 --> 00:00:24.313
unataka kila kitendakazi kifanye kidogo zaidi

00:00:24.413 --> 00:00:27.533
kinachowezekana. Tunaita hili kitendakazi kuwa na

00:00:27.713 --> 00:00:31.333
jukumu moja (<i>single responsibility</i> kwa Kiingereza). Kila kitendakazi kinapaswa kufanya jambo moja

00:00:31.413 --> 00:00:34.113
tu, na kutumia vitendakazi vingine kwa

00:00:34.253 --> 00:00:36.913
sehemu ndogo tofauti za jambo hilo. Hebu tuangalie

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:40.393
mfano. Fikiria tuna kitendakazi ambacho kazi yake

00:00:40.433 --> 00:00:43.613
ni kurejesha string inayoelezea

00:00:43.653 --> 00:00:46.193
jina. Toleo rahisi lingeonekana

00:00:46.233 --> 00:00:48.893
hivi. Tuna kitanzi cha kuhesabu, kitu

00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:52.033
ambacho tayari umeandika, kisha kiolezo cha string

00:00:52.073 --> 00:00:55.553
kinachounganisha matokeo. Sasa, hii inafanya kazi

00:00:55.573 --> 00:00:58.023
vizuri, lakini inafanya mambo mawili. Inafanya

00:00:58.113 --> 00:01:01.723
jambo moja la jumla kabisa, kuhesabu, na jingine

00:01:01.893 --> 00:01:04.873
mahususi sana, kujenga string hii katika

00:01:04.893 --> 00:01:09.102
muundo fulani. Itakuwa vizuri zaidi kugawanya

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:12.263
hii katika vitendakazi viwili, kimoja kinachohusika na

00:01:12.293 --> 00:01:15.893
kuhesabu na kingine kinachohusika na kuelezea

00:01:15.903 --> 00:01:19.133
jina katika muundo huu mahususi. Na kisha

00:01:19.173 --> 00:01:23.323
tunaweza kutumia tena kitendakazi hicho cha jumla cha kuhesabu

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:27.083
katika kupanga string hii, lakini pia mahali popote

00:01:27.173 --> 00:01:29.412
pengine tunapohitaji. Kila tunapohitaji kuhesabu

00:01:29.473 --> 00:01:32.333
herufi katika string, kitendakazi hicho hakina uhusiano wowote

00:01:32.393 --> 00:01:35.633
na mambo yanayohusiana na uchapishaji. Unaweza

00:01:35.653 --> 00:01:39.813
kusoma vitendakazi vyote viwili kivyake na kuelewa mara moja

00:01:39.873 --> 00:01:43.153
kila kimoja kinafanya nini. Kadiri vitendakazi vyako

00:01:43.193 --> 00:01:45.203
vinavyozidi kuwa changamano na unavyokuwa

00:01:45.203 --> 00:01:47.513
navyo vingi zaidi, mbinu hii ndiyo

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:51.793
tofauti kati ya kuwa na msimbo nadhifu na unaosomeka,

00:01:52.013 --> 00:01:54.833
na mkanganyiko na mvurugo mtupu. Kuna jambo moja

00:01:54.853 --> 00:01:56.553
ambalo nimeligusia mara kadhaa, lakini

00:01:56.593 --> 00:01:58.793
nataka kulitaja tena hapa, nalo ni

00:01:58.853 --> 00:02:02.213
kwamba kitu chochote unachounda ndani ya kitendakazi hakiwezi

00:02:02.253 --> 00:02:05.933
kufikiwa na vitendakazi vingine isipokuwa ukikirejesha

00:02:05.973 --> 00:02:09.313
kwa makusudi. Kwa hivyo ukijaribu kurejelea

00:02:09.333 --> 00:02:14.053
variable count (idadi) kutoka ndani ya describeName (eleza jina),

00:02:14.113 --> 00:02:15.763
hutaweza, kwa sababu ni mali ya

00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:19.633
kitendakazi kingine. Katika JavaScript, tunaweza kuunda

00:02:19.693 --> 00:02:22.553
variable juu kabla ya kila kitu, ambazo

00:02:22.613 --> 00:02:25.713
zinashirikiwa kati ya vitendakazi, lakini nakushauri sana

00:02:25.873 --> 00:02:27.973
usifanye hivyo isipokuwa kuna sababu nzuri

00:02:27.993 --> 00:02:32.193
sana. Kadiri unavyoweka kila kitendakazi kikiwa huru,

00:02:32.253 --> 00:02:34.253
na neno la kiufundi kwa hilo ni safi (<i>pure</i> kwa Kiingereza),

00:02:34.553 --> 00:02:38.393
yaani vitendakazi safi, ndivyo msimbo wako utakavyokuwa nadhifu zaidi

00:02:38.413 --> 00:02:40.493
na ndivyo hitilafu utakazounda na kuzipata

00:02:40.533 --> 00:02:42.763
zitakavyopungua. Katika mazoezi yanayofuata,

00:02:42.773 --> 00:02:45.213
utaandika vitendakazi vinavyofanya kazi pamoja ili

00:02:45.313 --> 00:02:48.613
kutatua matatizo, kitendakazi kimoja kikiita kingine, kila kimoja

00:02:48.693 --> 00:02:51.613
kikifanya kazi yake ndogo. Yafanye

00:02:51.633 --> 00:02:53.113
bila haraka, na tutaonana hapa tena

00:02:53.153 --> 00:02:53.433
hivi karibuni.
